Z||000004||GT Bastard||03-23-2001||01:32 PM||||TwisT, come down Saturday night and we'll round up some races.  Saturday should be really good for races if the weather is decent.  <P>1FST can probably tell you more about the mods to it than I can. <P>4-puck ACT clutch<BR>Chris West headers(although they didn't really gain anything on the dyno)<BR>Custom 2.5 exhaust, no cat, flowmaster<BR>fuel system and computer related changes(diff prom)<BR>4.10, 4sp tranny<BR>Furby<BR>MSD ingnition<BR>modified intake<BR>larger TB<BR>Extrude honed intake<BR>Si valves and stiffer springs<BR>I know I'm missing stuff<P><p>[This message has been edited by GT Bastard (edited 03-23-2001).]||||reg||1
